# Need a djembe to play at home?

We have been busy busy in the workshop and have a beautiful new selection of djembes made and ready to play. We have beautiful drums from Mali and Guinea all ready to be played and lots of djembes from Ghana which are great for kids or as entry level drums. All djembes are hand carved in Africa and we use top quality marine grade rope and Australian goat and cow skin so all our drums sound amazing! Check out this poster for more info or chat with Nat the next time you see him!
